`uses-method-in` is the CANONICAL ASSERTED DIRECTION per `protocol/predicate_lifecycle.md` §"Edge assertion is one-sided".  Its inverse `provides-method-for` is derivable via OWL 2 RL prp-inv1/inv2 entailment when `:dt/inverse-of :mm.memory/provides-method-for` is declared in the substrate.

